 {
  "text": "I love watching series. My favorite is a police series from the United States. I watch one episode every night, after dinner. I do not like action movies. For me they are boring, and they are always very long. On Friday I watch a movie with my sister, and she chooses. That is the rule.",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a6_listening1.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Music is my life. I listen to music all day. In the office I like listening to rock, because it is fast and I work fast. In the car I listen to samba, because the traffic is terrible and samba is happy. I hate silence. On Saturday I go to a party with my friends, and there is always music.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a6_listening2.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Giovanna finishes work on Friday. She is free for the weekend. On Saturday she goes to a party with her friends. On Sunday she watches a movie at home. On Sunday night she chooses a new series.",
